tent": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment. "}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "At the Travel Agent"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Sally Needs A Vacation"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Out and About in the City > Mexico City"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately explain information about interests, hobbies and preferences in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking Follow-up Questions (Showing Interest and Surprise)"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "For showing interest and surprise in conversations you can use some verbs with infinitives such as want to and like to. Also in conversations you can ask short questions about something that someone has just said.<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Follow-up Questions: </span><br/> You use follow-up questions when you want to encourage someone to talk more, or to show you are interested or surprised about something. <br/>A follow-up question can start with a Wh-question, like <span class=\"italic\">What, Where, When, Why</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Who</span>.<br/> When you hear something new, you can show you are surprised."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Showing Interest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Showing Surprise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\"><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Leah</span>: I want to go on vacation.<br/> <span class = \\\"strong\\\">Carol</span>: Where to?<br/><br/><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Leah</span>: I want to ask you something.<br/><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Chris</span>: *Ask me something? What is it?<br/><br/>*You can also use <span class = \\\"italic\\\">Mmhm</span> to show that you are interested.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\"><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Mike</span>: I want to take some time off from work.<br/> <span class = \\\"strong\\\">Jay</span>: *Time off?<br/><br>* You can also use Really? to show you are surprised.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Some other examples of follow-up questions are: <br/>  <span class = \\\"italic\\\"> When do you leave? <br/> What was it like? <br/> Who did you go with? <br/> Why is that? <br/> How was it?</br>What did you see? <span/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You can also use these phrases to show surprise: <br/> <span class = \\\"italic\\\">Wow! <br/> No way! <br/> Oh my gosh! <br/> Get out of here!</br>Really?! <span/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le04ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vacation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a period of free time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need a vacation. I'm tired."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use at work to talk about vacations."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a little slow"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use this to describe a store with a few customers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How is the store today?<br><span class=\"strong\"> Sasha</span>: It's a little slow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in a good mood"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use this to say that a person is happy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You seem like you're in a good mood."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "time off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "time away from work or school"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to take time off work."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a week off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "one week away from work or school"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to take a week off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "really "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use this to express surprise"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong'>Sally</span>: I want to take a week off. <span class=\"strong\">Sasha</span>: Really?!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read each role and choose one."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the situation with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1: </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are the boss. The clerk asks you for time off for a vacation. You are surprised and interested in what they say. Ask follow-up questions.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You are the clerk. You want to go on a vacation. Ask your boss for time off. Answer their questions.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ask for time off."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I respond to requests using follow-up questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I show surprise and interest."}]}], "type": "sena"}